8. thigh length (thigh_length_cm, crotch/inseam line to kneecap/knee center)
9. calf length (calf_length_cm, kneecap/knee center to lateral malleolus/ankle)
10. neck length (neck_length_cm, front visual line from below jaw/chin to front neck/collarbone line)
