12. leg length (leg_length_cm, visible pelvis point/ASIS level to lateral malleolus/ankle; this is lower-body length, not inseam length)

Circumferences (5-7) and lengths (8-12) are different measurements of the same body part.
Do not copy one into the other: thigh_cm wraps around the thigh, thigh_length_cm runs down it.

